Really cute pixel chill game, with great graphic and sounds.
However keep in mind you can finish it in under 3 hours, I took 3.3 for 100% and took my time to be honest.
I got it as a christmas gift, so I would recommend to buy it in sale if you want it. Certainly fun but too short for the price. ;A;
